---
import Icon from './Icon.astro';

const workers = ['Consumer contract', 'State ownership', 'Accessibility and interaction', 'Visual proof', 'Scope and simplicity'];
---

<figure class="pipe" aria-labelledby="pipe-cap">
  <figcaption id="pipe-cap" class="visually-hidden">
    The review pipeline: a git push triggers a pre-push hook running Codex CLI, which runs an API breaking-change scanner and a
    review orchestrator with five specialized workers, consolidated into one review.
  </figcaption>

  <div class="pipe-start">
    <span class="node node--sm"><Icon name="code" />git push</span>
    <i class="v" aria-hidden="true"></i>
    <span class="node node--sm">Pre-push hook <span class="dim">runs Codex CLI</span></span>
  </div>

  <div class="fork" aria-hidden="true"><i class="stem"></i><i class="bar"></i><i class="drop l"></i><i class="drop r"></i></div>

  <div class="tools">
    <div class="tool">
      <p class="src">Designed from every hotfix, revert and incident in the repo’s history</p>
      <div class="node">
        <span class="title">API breaking-change scanner</span>
        <span class="desc">An 11-step pass over the diff from every angle a consumer feels: API contracts, types, accessibility, CSS, events, refs. Findings ranked P1 to P3.</span>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="tool">
      <p class="src">Calibrated on 100+ review comments distilled from thousands</p>
      <div class="node">
        <span class="title">Review orchestrator</span>
        <span class="workers">{workers.map((w) => <span>{w}</span>)}</span>
        <span class="desc">Each worker catches what the other four miss; a parent dedupes and consolidates.</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="fork fork--join" aria-hidden="true"><i class="stem"></i><i class="bar"></i><i class="drop l"></i><i class="drop r"></i></div>

  <div class="pipe-end">
    <span class="node node--sm node--result"><Icon name="check" />One consolidated review before the code leaves the machine</span>
  </div>
</figure>

<style>
  .pipe { display: grid; font-size: 0.9375rem; }
  .pipe-start, .pipe-end { display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; }
  .v { width: 1px; height: 18px; background: var(--rule-2); }
  .node {
    display: grid;
    gap: 6px;
    padding: 14px 16px;
    border: 1px solid var(--rule-2);
    border-radius: 10px;
    background: var(--paper);
  }
  .node--sm {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
    padding: 8px 14px;
    font-weight: 620;
    font-stretch: 92%;
    white-space: nowrap;
  }
  .node--sm :global(svg) { width: 15px; height: 15px; color: var(--ink-2); }
  .node--result { white-space: normal; text-align: center; border-color: var(--ink); }
  .dim { color: var(--ink-3); font-weight: 500; font-size: 0.875rem; }
  .title { font-weight: 700; font-stretch: 94%; }
  .desc { color: var(--ink-2); font-size: 0.875rem; line-height: 1.5; }
  .src {
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    font-stretch: 84%;
    color: var(--ink-3);
    padding: 0 2px 8px;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
    border-bottom: 1px dashed var(--rule-2);
  }
  .tools { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 14px; }
  .tool { display: grid; align-content: start; }
  .workers { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 5px; margin-block: 4px; }
  .workers span {
    padding: 3px 9px;
    border: 1px solid var(--rule-2);
    border-radius: 999px;
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 580;
    font-stretch: 90%;
  }
  .fork { position: relative; height: 30px; }
  .fork i { position: absolute; background: var(--rule-2); }
  .fork .stem { left: 50%; top: 0; width: 1px; height: 50%; }
  .fork .bar { left: 25%; right: 25%; top: 50%; height: 1px; }
  .fork .drop { top: 50%; width: 1px; height: 50%; }
  .fork .l { left: 25%; }
  .fork .r { left: 75%; }
  .fork--join .stem { top: 50%; }
  .fork--join .drop { top: 0; }

  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .tools { grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr); gap: 24px; }
    .fork .bar, .fork .drop { display: none; }
    .fork .stem { top: 0; height: 100%; }
    .node--sm { white-space: normal; }
  }
</style>
